{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "05070bc4f9462d0db8c2f19c0dc768f549587ccb0dd2591bbf8d6b6b2cef7c18", "ja": "（『Sunshine Rhythm!』の公演は無事終了。\n今日は何故か、翼の買い物に付き合うことになった）", "zh": "（『Sunshine Rhythm!』的公演顺利结束了。\n而今天不知怎的变成陪翼出来买东西。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e289689970d5f5fffad25b910e5698d3cf584e5c7345d31a2ca6a4a7c5f17bf5", "ja": "えへへ、何度もおねだりして正解でした！\n{$P$}さんとのショッピング♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，一直拜托果然是对的！\n跟{$P$}先生购物去啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a2a9951258c7b61b43dd811a10a9a0d91f65f7e74104fa1a629c6b741b0e2223", "ja": "まぁ、今回の公演は、翼もいろいろと\n気にかけてくれたからな……そのお礼だよ。", "zh": "也罢，在这次的公演，\n翼也一直很关心大家……就当是回报你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3192c8f2b72b189f40bf868b1e0ff79c0d8fb65cbad94be4291882ee28a61d79", "ja": "だから、特別だぞ。\nそんなに毎回は付き合えないからな。", "zh": "所以这次是特例喔，\n毕竟我可没办法每次都陪你出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "848e8a55cbe0f3737b7105ab83e62bf94f909e6b8380cd5fb29dc5a1f6af220e", "ja": "ええ～、そうなんですか～？　……でも、いっか。\nだって付き合ってくれるのはおんなじだし♪", "zh": "咦咦～是这样吗～？\n……不过算了，反正你还是会陪我出来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d644c1e20783d790200406e91d6b55ca6945c16a2354a8163135f55d68a0082d", "ja": "それじゃあ、さっそく行きましょー！　目指すは、\nトッテモタカイタウンのショッピングモールです♪", "zh": "那我们马上出发吧──！\n目的地就是高耸入云城的购物中心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7dc382f283c45e35bbb3d482d7e015f5adee2db82891b39791d38db05d0010da", "ja": "この前みんなと行った時に、気になるお洋服とか、\nカワイイ雑貨がたくさんあったんですよね～♪", "zh": "之前跟大家一起去的时候，\n有看到不少中意的洋装，跟可爱的杂货呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bc5bb19e7157d2e550c917e6e03afc70f66c5874a947111a2e1ecf4c64e060df", "ja": "あ、翼！？\n人が多いんだから、走っちゃダメだぞー！", "zh": "啊，翼！？\n这里人很多，不可以用跑的喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0cdb14dc7bdde16ebb60d5cfa2e7c7a21747cd8e256bf066bdaabe27a450db56", "ja": "あっ！\nこのクレープ屋さん、雑誌に載ってたお店だ～！", "zh": "啊！\n这家可丽饼店，我有在杂志上看过～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a38d80091f7aea4da78fee6c0f3d21a3933a638cc81b45116ec4b5df470557f3", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}さん、\nわたし、食べてみたいなー。", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生，\n人家想吃那个～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d55d4863b78dedc9bb35d8c06bc000c94527f4f5a2711c0bb4784c4b528a01e6", "ja": "クレープか……まぁそれくらいならいいか。\nじゃあ、好きなのを選んで。", "zh": "可丽饼啊……这个倒是无所谓。\n你直接选想吃的口味吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9b3ad1fcbb51f5d21baf56019cfd618dc6686b76c3c164fe084726b0df678987", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございまーす！　じゃあ、\nフルーツミックスのWクリームにアイスを乗せて……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你～！\n那我要双层奶油的综合水果加冰淇淋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1013_p", "source_sha256": "16a9335c0dd87a0c688d853b7cae8ff7a14c90a50284b60a884e48323d66ac8b", "ja": "トッピングも乗せるんだな……。", "zh": "居然还加配料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1014_null", "source_sha256": "2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3", "ja": "数十分後……", "zh": "数十分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "87a9d3aafe70a54fb2e4aab4170b2e5bf66b5493f997d7d1ac9b2d4c27494a68", "ja": "あ！　あそこのカフェ、新しいお店みたい！\n{$P$}さん、寄っていきません？", "zh": "啊！那间咖啡厅好像是新开的！\n{$P$}先生，要不要去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2ce0d10f8237cb4055655ae7f3bf632c5b5a44b5b049c7e1cc371d6370954508", "ja": "まぁ……カフェに寄るくらいなら……。", "zh": "嗯……去咖啡厅是可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e9628b9008d07e5b7c5392af83a33d5d0e2b9537fa8aa5c35153258181968e81", "ja": "やった！　じゃあわたし、キャラメルラテと～。\nあっ、ケーキも頼んじゃおうかな？", "zh": "耶！那我要点焦糖拿铁，还有～\n啊，再点个蛋糕好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a62213c0c9e6ab08e29c7550faaee022c758f5792456e179b81a1b4e420ac051", "ja": "ほ、ほどほどにしてくれよ……。", "zh": "你、你要适可而止喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1019_null", "source_sha256": "311ede534d9960246bbb9e1571ddfb55d07661d62503a011afc8eab6f8416582", "ja": "さらに、数十分後……", "zh": "又过了数十分钟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1f11952f45f96d77a77241c5ab750a4122787319645ce1fca6f49dbbaed93529", "ja": "あー！　みてみて、{$P$}さん！\nこんなところにアクセサリーショップが……！", "zh": "啊──！{$P$}先生，你看你看！\n这里居然有家饰品店……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1021_p", "source_sha256": "22ba97dd00d6e6ac3ae148316dba4c66c46efc2111148c1546572297a95a3973", "ja": "待て待て！　翼、これからショッピングモールに\n行くっていうのに、寄り道しすぎじゃないか？", "zh": "停停停！翼，我们明明是要去购物中心，\n你这样不会偏离目的地太多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4effdd032d82e97619730d5b6ccb0a02051ceae403f4dc0e72ec889143dfeeaf", "ja": "えー？　だって、1日は長いんですから！\nこれくらい、まだまだ序盤ですよ♪", "zh": "咦～？可是一天有那么多时间耶！\n这还只是开头而已喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b0076b5ebddc2868233cbe5af163fc52cd96c3bc568c2bc59a3ab36dcbc8c3a", "ja": "このあとはウィンドウショッピングをして……\nあ！　ディナーは、ステーキが食べたいな～♪", "zh": "等等要逛逛商店的橱窗……\n啊！晚餐我想吃牛排～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d0d10e97f56a6238b3dfd454a71c459f03de78aefed3e682ebf16b784ef78c63", "ja": "今日は{$P$}さんからのごほうび、\n目いっぱい楽しんじゃいまーす♪", "zh": "今天是{$P$}先生给的奖励，\n人家要好好玩个痛快～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0083_1025_p", "source_sha256": "df880a6a0b4d711b6c120ff82781e26286394ce53624853fa90a241f4a57e702", "ja": "（気軽に言ってくれるな。でも翼は嬉しそうだし、\nたまには……本当にたまになら、まぁいいか……）", "zh": "（别说得这么轻松啊。不过翼好像很开心，\n偶尔……真的是很偶尔的话，是没关系啦……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
